// Third `Blink` player spell in this batch (see misty_step.ron for the
// pilot notes on the variant itself).
//
// Deviation from the sheet, flagged for reviewer attention: the sheet
// describes a thunder burst at the departure point damaging nearby
// creatures on a failed save. `CharacterAbility::Blink` carries no
// damage/attack fields whatsoever (common/src/comp/ability.rs) -- unlike
// `Explosion` or `Shockwave`, there is no secondary-effect hook this variant
// can trigger. The departure burst is therefore dropped entirely, not
// reinterpreted; this ships as a pure self-teleport, mechanically identical
// in shape to vortex_warp.ron but with this spell's own range/cooldown. The
// flavor text does not claim any damage happens.
Blink(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    max_range: 27.0,
    frontend_specifier: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Arcane), cooldown: Some(18.0)),
)
